---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | APIRank"
  description="APIRank terms of use: acceptable use, content accuracy disclaimer, third-party services, intellectual property, and limitations of liability."
  canonicalUrl="https://apirank.vip/terms/"
>
  <div class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
        <span>›</span>
        <span class="text-gray-900 font-medium">Terms of Use</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: July 29, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your access to and use of <strong>APIRank</strong>
        (apirank.vip) (the "Site"). By accessing or using the Site, you agree to be bound
        by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">1. Service Description</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        APIRank is an independent information site that compares AI API pricing and publishes
        reviews and tutorials. We are <strong>not</strong> an AI API provider, we do not
        sell API keys, and we do not process API calls on behalf of users. All purchases,
        accounts, and technical support are handled by the third-party providers we list.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">2. Content Accuracy and Pricing Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        AI API providers change pricing frequently — sometimes monthly, weekly, or even
        without public announcement. While we make reasonable efforts to verify pricing,
        specifications, and policy details, we <strong>cannot guarantee</strong> that all
        information on the Site is current or error-free at the moment you view it.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Before making any purchase decision, please verify the latest pricing and terms
        directly on the official website of the relevant provider. APIRank is not liable
        for losses arising from reliance on information presented on the Site.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        We display a "Last verified" date on each pricing data source. If you spot an
        error, please report it via <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 underline">our
        contact page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">3. Third-Party Services and External Links</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The Site contains links to third-party websites ("Outbound Links") operated by
        AI API providers, their resellers, or other parties we believe are relevant to
        our readers. We do not control, endorse, or guarantee the content, services, or
        products offered by any third party.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Your interactions with third parties — including purchases, account creation,
        and the handling of your personal data by those parties — are solely between you
        and the third party. Please review their terms and privacy policies before use.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">4. Affiliate Relationships</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Some Outbound Links are affiliate links. When you click an affiliate link and
        subsequently sign up or make a purchase, we may receive a commission at no extra
        cost to you. Affiliate relationships do not influence our rankings, reviews, or
        editorial recommendations. For more detail, see our
        <a href="/editorial-policy" class="text-blue-600 underline">Editorial Policy</a>
        and <a href="/privacy" class="text-blue-600 underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        All content published on this Site — including articles, reviews, comparison
        tables, the APIRank name and logo, and the design of the Site — is owned by
        APIRank (or its licensors) and is protected by applicable copyright and trademark
        law.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        You may quote brief excerpts for non-commercial purposes (such as a blog post or
        forum thread) provided that you credit "APIRank (apirank.vip)" and link back to
        the source page. You may not reproduce full articles, scrape the Site at scale,
        republish our data, or present our content as your own without written permission.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Provider names, logos, model names, and pricing referenced on the Site are the
        property of their respective owners and are used for identification and editorial
        commentary only.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">6. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">You agree not to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Scrape, crawl, or otherwise extract Site content at scale without prior written permission</li>
        <li>Use the Site to harass, defame, or impersonate any person or organization</li>
        <li>Attempt to disrupt the Site, its hosting, or its security (e.g., DDoS, SQL injection, credential stuffing)</li>
        <li>Use the Site to advertise or solicit users for unrelated products or services without our consent</li>
        <li>Use automated means to click ads, manipulate referrals, or generate fraudulent traffic to our partners</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The Site is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. To the maximum extent
        permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties, express or implied, including the
        implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and
        non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted,
        error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, APIRank and its operator shall not be
        liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages
        arising out of or related to your use of the Site, including but not limited to
        loss of profits, data, business opportunity, or goodwill, even if advised of the
        possibility of such damages.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        We may update these Terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date above
        reflects the most recent change. Material changes will be announced on the
        homepage. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the
        updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        These Terms are governed by the laws applicable to the operator of APIRank,
        without regard to conflict-of-laws principles. Any dispute arising from these
        Terms or your use of the Site shall be resolved in good faith; if informal
        resolution fails, the competent courts at the operator's registered location
        shall have exclusive jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">11. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">For questions about these Terms:</p>
      <ul class="list-none space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>📧 Email: <a href="mailto:contact@apirank.vip" class="text-blue-600 underline">contact@apirank.vip</a></li>
        <li>📝 Use the <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 underline">contact form</a> on our site</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>